te();\r\n\r\nconst tokenAccount = await getAssociatedTokenAddress(\r\n    mint.publicKey,\r\n    destination.publicKey,\r\n);\r\n\r\n// Create ATA creation instruction\r\nconst createAtaInstruction = createAssociatedTokenAccountIdempotentInstruction(\r\n    keypair.publicKey, // payer\r\n    tokenAccount, // associated token account address\r\n    destination.publicKey, // owner\r\n    mint.publicKey, // mint\r\n);\r\n\r\n// Mint tokens to ATA \r\nconst mintToInstruction = createMintToInstruction(\r\n    mint.publicKey, // mint\r\n    tokenAccount, // destination\r\n    keypair.publicKey, // mint authority\r\n    1_000e6, // amount of tokens\r\n);\r\n\r\nconst transaction = new Transaction().add(\r\n    createAtaInstruction,\r\n    mintToInstruction,\r\n);\r\n\r\nconst signature = await sendAndConfirmTransaction(connection, transaction, [keypair]);\r\n\r\nconsole.log(`Token accounts created and tokens minted! Check out your TX here: https://explorer.solana.com/tx/${signature}?cluster=devnet`);","position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":1,"offset":432},"end":{"line":49,"column":4,"offset":1426}},"data":{"highlightId":"code-0"}},{"type":"mdxJsxFlowElement","name":"ArticleSection","attributes":[{"type":"mdxJsxAttribute","name":"name","value":"抽象指令","position":{"start":{"line":51,"column":17,"offset":1446},"end":{"line":51,"column":28,"offset":1457}}},{"type":"mdxJsxAttribute","name":"id","value":"abstracted-instruction","position":{"start":{"line":51,"column":29,"offset":1458},"end":{"line":51,"column":56,"offset":1485}}},{"type":"mdxJsxAttribute","name":"level","value":"h2","position":{"start":{"line":51,"column":57,"offset":1486},"end":{"line":51,"column":67,"offset":1496}}}],"children":[],"position":{"start":{"line":51,"column":1,"offset":1430},"end":{"line":51,"column":70,"offset":1499}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"這是使用","position":{"start":{"line":53,"column":1,"offset":1503},"end":{"line":53,"column":5,"offset":1507}}},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"mintTo()","position":{"start":{"line":53,"column":5,"offset":1507},"end":{"line":53,"column":15,"offset":1517}}},{"type":"text","value":"指令進行抽象後的相同指令的樣子：","position":{"start":{"line":53,"column":15,"offset":1517},"end":{"line":53,"column":31,"offset":1533}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":53,"column":1,"offset":1503},"end":{"line":53,"column":31,"offset":1533}}},{"type":"code","lang":"ts","meta":null,"value":"const destination = Keypair.generate();\r\n\r\nconst ata = await getOrCreateAssociatedTokenAccount(\r\n    connection,\r\n    keypair,\r\n    mint,\r\n    destination.publicKey\r\n);\r\n\r\nconsole.log(`This is your ATA: ${ata.address}!`)\r\n  \r\nlet tx = await mintTo(\r\n    connection,\r\n    keypair,\r\n    mint,\r\n    ata.address,\r\n    keypair.publicKey,\r\n    1e6,\r\n);\r\n\r\nconsole.log(`Succesfully Minted!. Transaction Here: https://explorer.solana.com/tx/${tx}?cluster=devnet`)","position":{"start":{"line":55,"column":1,"offset":1537},"end":{"line":77,"column":4,"offset":2004}},"data":{"highlightId":"code-1"}}],"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1,"offset":0},"end":{"line":77,"column":4,"offset":2004}}},"raw":"import { ArticleSection } from \"../../../../components/ArticleSection/ArticleSection\";\r\n\r\n# Mint To 指令\r\n\r\n創建新代幣並將其存入指定帳戶。只有鑄幣權限持有人才能執行此操作。\r\n\r\n在我們鑄造任何代幣之前，我們需要已經擁有：\r\n- 已初始化的`Mint`帳戶，並且我們持有`mintAuthority`\r\n- 已初始化的`Token`帳戶或`Associated Token`帳戶，我們將把代幣鑄造到這些帳戶中\r\n\r\n> 我們鑄造的代幣數量是根據小數位數進行「標準化」的。這意味著，如果我們想鑄造一個有 6 位小數的代幣，我們實際上需要輸入`1e6`作為數量\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"原始指令\" id=\"raw-instruction\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\n僅使用「原始」指令而不進行任何抽象，這是鑄造代幣的方式：\r\n\r\n```ts\r\nconst destination = Keypair.generate();\r\n\r\nconst tokenAccount = await getAssociatedTokenAddress(\r\n    mint.publicKey,\r\n    destination.publicKey,\r\n);\r\n\r\n// Create ATA creation instruction\r\nconst createAtaInstruction = createAssociatedTokenAccountIdempotentInstruction(\r\n    keypair.publicKey, // payer\r\n    tokenAccount, // associated token account address\r\n    destination.publicKey, // owner\r\n    mint.publicKey, // mint\r\n);\r\n\r\n// Mint tokens to ATA \r\nconst mintToInstruction = createMintToInstruction(\r\n    mint.publicKey, // mint\r\n    tokenAccount, // destination\r\n    keypair.publicKey, // mint authority\r\n    1_000e6, // amount of tokens\r\n);\r\n\r\nconst transaction = new Transaction().add(\r\n    createAtaInstruction,\r\n    mintToInstruction,\r\n);\r\n\r\nconst signature = await sendAndConfirmTransaction(connection, transaction, [keypair]);\r\n\r\nconsole.log(`Token accounts created and tokens minted! Check out your TX here: https://explorer.solana.com/tx/${signature}?cluster=devnet`);\r\n```\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"抽象指令\" id=\"abstracted-instruction\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\n這是使用`mintTo()`指令進行抽象後的相同指令的樣子：\r\n\r\n```ts\r\nconst destination = Keypair.generate();\r\n\r\nconst ata = await getOrCreateAssociatedTokenAccount(\r\n    connection,\r\n    keypair,\r\n    mint,\r\n    destination.publicKey\r\n);\r\n\r\nconsole.log(`This is your ATA: ${ata.address}!`)\r\n  \r\nlet tx = await mintTo(\r\n    connection,\r\n    keypair,\r\n    mint,\r\n    ata.address,\r\n    keypair.publicKey,\r\n    1e6,\r\n);\r\n\r\nconsole.log(`Succesfully Minted!. Transaction Here: https://explorer.solana.com/tx/${tx}?cluster=devnet`)\r\n```","highlightedCode":{"code-0":{"lang":"ts","hast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"pre","properties":{"class":"shiki Kiloshift","style":"background-color:#11141a;color:#f6f6f4","tabindex":"0"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"code","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F286C4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"const"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" destination "}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"sty